abstract: >-
  Research software, source tables, and AGU 2026 poster materials for a
  seven-stage accounting model linking attempted agentic software-engineering
  work to token demand, benchmark-equivalent GPU service, facility electricity,
  U.S. electricity-source factors, and life-cycle emissions. Results are
  conditional scenarios, not observed labor displacement or commercial-provider
  energy measurements.
keywords:
  - agentic AI
  - software engineering
  - token accounting
  - GPU energy
  - data centers
  - carbon footprint
